            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.7.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 7:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.7.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma narora ebitebe by'obukama, abakaba babiikaliireho nubo abo abaahairwe obusobozi obw'okucwa emisango. Kandi narora emyoyo y'abo abaacwirweho emitwe habw'okujurra Kristo n'ekigambo kya Ruhanga. Nubo abo abatararamize kinyamaiswa rundi ekisisani kyakyo, abakaba batatairweho karorwaho kaakyo ha buso rundi ha mikono yabo. Baahumbuuka, baalema hamu na Kristo kumara emyaka rukumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafu abandi batahumbuuke okuhika emyaka egi rukumi obu yahoireho. Oku mukwo okuhumbuuka okw'okubanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "W'omugisa kandi ahikiriire anyakubagana ha kuhumbuuka okw'okubanza! Abali nk'abo, okufa okwa kabiri tikubainaho busobozi; baitu baliba banyakatagara ba Ruhanga na Kristo, balirema hamu nawe okumara emyaka rukumi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sitaani naasingulirwa kimu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
